w; the packet does not add an explicit unknown-vs-empty distinction (corrupt lines are parser warnings).\",\r\n    \"scope\": \"JSONL single-source path only; no Stage 3 contract change and no new UI/model wiring; no second DB/daemon/migration.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"independentVerification\": {\r\n    \"executed\": true,\r\n    \"kind\": \"real-filesystem append/read + failure injection\",\r\n    \"detail\": \"Tests write through the real appender, read back the real projection, replay a batch, block the ledger directory to force a write error, and check workspace isolation. Stage 3 projection/merge semantics remain covered by the existing contract test. No separate second-agent verifier role was run.\",\r\n    \"separateVerifierAgent\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"single-source\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Working Context reuses the existing workspace Task Ledger JSONL append/read/projection; no new table/snapshot/daemon/second store.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"consistent-view\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Appended proposal events read back into a consistent projection (pending contains the written proposal).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"idempotent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Replaying the same batchIdempotencyKey appends no duplicate event and yields an identical projection.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"observable-write-failure\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"When the ledger directory path is occupied by a file, append rejects (does not report success).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"isolation\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"A different workspaceId reads an empty view and has no ledger file.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"4 new + 10 regression tests pass, typecheck:test 0, scoped lint 0, harness validate/dry-run pass, comms 0, credential scan 0 hits, SHA256SUMS verifiable.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"productLocks\": {\r\n    \"live_ready\": false,\r\n    \"product_approved\": false,\r\n    \"default_on\": false,\r\n    \"changed\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"credentialScan\": {\r\n    \"files\": 2,\r\n    \"hits\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  \"notMeasured\": [\r\n    \"Live provider calls.\",\r\n    \"Corrupt-ledger behavior under a torn write (parser warnings only).\",\r\n    \"A separate second-agent independent verifier role.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"landing\": {\r\n    \"pushed\": false,\r\n    \"pr\": null,\r\n    \"note\": \"Pushed with the evidence commit in the same session; see the branch's PR.\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n=====DOC=====\r\n# L01：Working Context 账本作为唯一活任务读写源\r\n\r\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：L01（TF-0283）。真实 provider 调用：无。\r\n\r\n## 链路（write → ledger → read → projection）\r\n\r\n- 写：`appendTaskLedgerWorkingContextEvents(workspaceId, inputs, batchIdempotencyKey)` → `appendTaskLedgerEvents` → JSONL `events.jsonl`（`<configDir>/task-ledgers/workspaces/<key>/events.jsonl`）。\r\n- 读：`readTaskLedgerWorkingContext(workspaceId)` → `readTaskLedgerEvents` → `projectTaskLedgerWorkingContext(events)`。\r\n- **无第二来源**：适配器头注释即声明“复用既有 workspace Task Ledger JSONL appender 和 read path；不新增 table/snapshot/daemon/second store”。\r\n\r\n## 实测（真实文件系统）\r\n\r\n| 断言 | 结果 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| append → read → projection 一致（pending 含写入的 proposal） | ✅ |\r\n| ledger 文件恰好 1 行（事件落盘，非第二存储） | ✅ |\r\n| 同 batchIdempotencyKey 重放 → 不追加、projection 完全一致 | ✅ |\r\n| ledger 目录被同路径文件占用 → append **抛错**（不误报成功） | ✅ |\r\n| 不同 workspaceId 隔离（另一个 workspace 读到空视图） | ✅ |\r\n\r\nStage 3 投影/合并语义（确定性、重复 accept fail-closed、过期、冲突集、merge copyFields、malformed 决策 fail-closed）由既有 `tests/unit/context-control-plane-stage3-contracts.test.ts` 覆盖，本包不重复。\r\n\r\n## 残余（residual）\r\n\r\n- 读取时 ledger 文件缺失返回空视图（`{events:[],warnings:[]}`）；**损坏行**由既有 parser 以 warnings 表达，本包不新增“unknown vs empty”区分。\r\n- 本包只核验 JSONL 单源路径；不改 Stage 3 事件契约、不接线新 UI/模型入口。\r\n- 无第二 DB/daemon/迁移；不改产品默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\r\n=====SUMS=====\r\n0e0a4139520eec9ce4940ee7ea1e61e7eb86fd14c2e92cf0a37ccc97d368e141  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l01-acceptance.json\r\ne4414f4758a3a38703e720bb72e38d107a3d9937e0dac92891c7dd9a1423adca  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l01-working-context-single-source.md\r\na69c499b7864a03fc22e4e8dcfca58921d2b9de581d523cf2913f9763a786e25  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-working-context-single-source.md\r\n035ace35109f4f02fb7baade3ddba5f80edc7551d5b1ffc85535653c20a95616  tests/unit/task-ledger-working-context-single-source.test.ts\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
