iredTests covers the A1 gate criteria), keeping the original threshold bytes unchanged.\n\nLet me check how the \"counter test\" is referenced. Currently a1 spec requiredTests:\n- tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts\n- tests/unit/policy-light-snapshotter.test.ts\n- tests/unit/shadow-write-event-recorder.test.ts\n- tests/unit/trace-namespace-enforcement.test.ts\n- tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\n\nBut those files don't exist! Only tests/unit/deep/a1-deep.test.ts, openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts exist. Hmm interesting - so requiredTests point to non-existent paths. Let me verify whether they exist anywhere.\n\nEarlier I checked Test-Path for those exact paths -> False. Let me search for these file names.\n\nLet me search entire repo."}}
