14).\n+\n+ ## Out of scope\n+\n+ - Replacing `IsolationFailureRecovery` legacy path — only deprecation, not removal.\n+ - `dynamic_writes` heuristic detection (OQ-008).\n+ - Per-tool path-prefix allow-lists (future enhancement).\n+\n\n ❯ tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts:17:18\n     15|   it(\"keeps the A1 spec's requiredTests wired to the criterion-1/3/4 c…\n     16|     const spec = read(\"harness/specs/tasks/a1-layered-isolation-pilot.…\n     17|     expect(spec).toContain(\"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\");\n       |                  ^\n     18|     expect(spec).toContain(\"openclaw_runtime/src/observability/depreca…\n     19|     // The original graduation thresholds must not be redefined.\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[2/7]⎯\n\n FAIL  tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts > assertWriteRiskProfileForTool (A1 Stage 2 acceptance 2.2) > write tools (profile required) > passes with a durable_state profile\nAssertionError: expected [Function] to not throw an error but 'MissingWriteRiskProfileError: writeRi…' was thrown\n\n- Expected:\nundefined\n\n+ Received:\n\"MissingWriteRiskProfileError: writeRiskProfile.kind must be one of: no_writes, declared_paths, pattern_writes, dynamic_writes (got: durable_state)\"\n\n ❯ tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts:90:73\n     88|         requiresApproval: false,\n     89|       };\n     90|       expect(() => assertWriteRiskProfileForTool('write', profile)).no…\n       |                                                                         ^\n     91|     });\n     92|\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[3/7]⎯\n\n FAIL  tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts > assertWriteRiskProfileForTool (A1 Stage 2 acceptance 2.2) > helper functions > requiresApproval covers dynamic_writes and durable_state\nAssertionError: expected false to be true // Object.is equality\n\n- Expected\n+ Received\n\n- true\n+ false\n\n ❯ tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts:232:9\n    230|       expect(\n    231|         requiresApproval({ kind: 'durable_s