\nNote: the latest oracle-1 run used the grader's owned copies of the tests, and errors were relative to those. The stderr from treatment-1 matches the ClawX file content (the failures I read from the source). Let me verify: does the grader's tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts match ClawX's? Let me diff a couple to be sure the grader copies == ClawX copies.\n\nLet me just directly verify with hashes."}}
