{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_369","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"echo \\\"=== _ref-doc.md\\\"; Get-Content D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_ref-doc.md; echo \\\"=== _ref-acceptance.json\\\"; Get-Content D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_ref-acceptance.json\"","aggregated_output":"=== _ref-doc.md\r\n# S06：记忆写入与 EffectReceipt 恢复闭环\r\n\r\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：S06（TF-0281）。真实 provider 调用：无。\r\n\r\n## 链路（intent → decision → effect receipt）\r\n\r\n- `memory-self-edit-tools.ts`（`memory_update` / `memory_forget` / `memory_strengthen`）在写入决策点调用 `recordMemoryEffect`。\r\n- `memory-effect-receipt.ts` 构建 digest-only 视图并交给注入的 RC-04 `EffectReceiptStore`（structural sink，runtime-core 不在运行时 import agents/）。\r\n- RC-04 `effect_receipts`：append-only、idempotency key 唯一、identical-content→duplicate、content-conflict→拒绝。\r\n\r\n## 语义\r\n\r\n| 情形 | outcome |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 写入成功 | `applied` |\r\n| 写入前被拒（如 persistFact 失败，未产生副作用） | `not_applied` |\r\n| 已产生部分副作用后失败（fact 已 append 但 invalidation / supersedes relation 失败） | `unknown`（可据 `recoverability` 对账） |\r\n\r\n- idempotency key = `memory-effect:v1:<sha256(action ⋮ factId ⋮ sessionKey ⋮ runId ⋮ toolCallId)>`，**与 outcome 无关** → 重放同意图命中同一 key。\r\n- proposal 只含 `domain/action/factId(/newFactId)`，**绝不含记忆正文**；actor/effect 走 `stage1Context`。\r\n- fail-open：无 sink 或 sink 抛错都不阻断 memory 写入。\r\n\r\n## 实测（真实数据）\r\n\r\n- 真实 `EffectReceiptStore` + 真实 `RuntimeMemoryStore`：一次 `memory_update` → 恰好 1 行 receipt（`domain_executor='clawx-runtime-memory'`, `outcome='applied'`）；重放同意图 → `duplicate:true` 且返回同一 `effectReceiptId`（0 个重复 effect）。\r\n- builder 单测：key 与 outcome 无关；proposal digest-only（不含 objectSummary/subject/predicate）；unknown 原样保留不伪装 applied；fail-open。\r\n\r\n## 残余（residual）\r\n\r\n- sink 需由调用方注入（本次测试注入真实 store）；真正的生产装配点（把 RC-04 store 接到 memory 工具上下文）留给集成层，本包不接线到 agent 注册。\r\n- `memory_recall` / `memory_find_related` 是只读，不产生 effect receipt。\r\n- 不改默认自动写回、产品默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\r\n=== _ref-acceptance.json\r\n{\r\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\r\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"codex-s06-mainline-developer\",\r\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\r\n  \"scope\": {\r\n    \"task\": \"TF-0281\",\r\n    \"packet\": \"S06\",\r\n    \"title\": \"Memory writes correlate with the RC-04 EffectReceipt recovery loop\",\r\n    \"source\": \"real EffectReceiptStore + real RuntimeMemoryStore (no live provider)\",\r\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\r\n    \"realHuman\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"decision\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"Memory self-edit writes now record digest-only effect receipts through the real RC-04 store: one row per write, deterministic per-intent idempotency (replay -> duplicate, 0 duplicate effects), outcome applied/not_applied/unknown preserved, fail-open. Regression 86 tests pass.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"candidate\": {\r\n    \"commit\": \"3a1e2d384710927bc13aa1e92962824a8b88b7de\",\r\n    \"tree\": \"a8a370415a67aae26f33f2a57d3a8d804f59a0a2\",\r\n    \"dirty\": false,\r\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-s06-memory-effect-receipt-20261013\",\r\n    \"base\": \"8c34f6ca3a4151bf60626447a250044bba8ac423\",\r\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\r\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:06:00.000Z\",\r\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:18:00.000Z\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"effectLoop\": {\r\n    \"module\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.ts\",\r\n    \"sink\": \"RC-04 EffectReceiptStore (structural MemoryEffectReceiptSink; runtime-core does not import agents/ at runtime)\",\r\n    \"wiredActions\": [\r\n      \"memory_update\",\r\n      \"memory_forget\",\r\n      \"memory_strengthen\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"idempotencyKey\": \"memory-effect:v1:<sha256(action|factId|sessionKey|runId|toolCallId)> - outcome-independent, so a replayed intent is a duplicate\",\r\n    \"proposalFields\": [\r\n      \"domain\",\r\n      \"action\",\r\n      \"factId\",\r\n      \"newFactId?\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"outcomeMapping\": {\r\n      \"success\": \"applied\",\r\n      \"pre-effect-failure\": \"not_applied\",\r\n      \"partial-effect-failure\": \"unknown\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"failOpen\": true,\r\n    \"credentialOrContentInProposal\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"gates\": {\r\n    \"s06Tests\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-vitest src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 1,\r\n      \"tests\": 5,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"effectReceiptRegression\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-vitest apply-patch-effect-receipt.test.ts stage1-effect-receipt.test.ts memory-effect-receipt.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 3,\r\n      \"tests\": 24,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"memorySuite\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-vitest src/memory\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 2,\r\n      \"tests\": 62,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"typecheckCore\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: pnpm run tsgo:core\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"lintTouched\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-oxlint memory-effect-receipt.ts memory-self-edit-tools.ts memory-effect-receipt.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessValidate\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-memory-effect-receipt.md\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"Spec is valid\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessDryRun\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-memory-effect-receipt.md --dry-run\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsReplay\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:replay\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsCompare\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:compare\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"all PASS, 0.00% delta\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"residual\": {\r\n    \"productionAssembly\": \"The sink must be injected; the production wiring that attaches the RC-04 store to the memory tool context is left to the integration layer (this packet does not register the tools).\",\r\n    \"readTools\": \"memory_recall / memory_find_related are read-only and produce no effect receipt.\",\r\n    \"scope\": \"Runtime memory self-edit only; no change to default auto-writeback, product defaults, locks, or approval semantics.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"independentVerification\": {\r\n    \"executed\": true,\r\n    \"kind\": \"unit + real-store integration\",\r\n    \"detail\": \"The real EffectReceiptStore writes a row for a real memory_update and treats a replay as identical-content duplicate; the builder unit test asserts digest-only proposals, outcome-independent keys, fail-open, and unknown preservation. No separate second-agent verifier role was run.\",\r\n    \"separateVerifierAgent\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"reuse-store\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Reuses RC-04 EffectReceiptStore (append-only, idempotency unique, identical-content vs conflict); no second effect store.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"digest-only\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"proposal carries identifiers only; no memory content, credentials, or raw payload.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"traceable\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"stage1Context carries actor (sessionKey/runId/attempt/modelCall) and effect (toolCallId/toolName/resource/action); the store returns an effectReceiptId.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"idempotent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Replaying the same intent hits the same idempotency key and returns duplicate:true with the same effectReceiptId; 0 duplicate effects.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"outcome-honest\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"applied / not_applied / unknown mapped explicitly; a partial failure is recorded unknown, never disguised as applied.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"fail-open\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"A missing or throwing sink never blocks or fails the memory write.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"5 new + 86 regression tests pass, tsgo:core 0, scoped lint 0, harness validate/dry-run pass, comms 0, credential scan 0 hits, SHA256SUMS verifiable.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"productLocks\": {\r\n    \"live_ready\": false,\r\n    \"product_approved\": false,\r\n    \"default_on\": false,\r\n    \"changed\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"credentialScan\": {\r\n    \"files\": 4,\r\n    \"hits\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  \"notMeasured\": [\r\n    \"Live provider calls.\",\r\n    \"Production assembly of the RC-04 sink into the agent tool context.\",\r\n    \"A separate second-agent independent verifier role.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"landing\": {\r\n    \"pushed\": false,\r\n    \"pr\": null,\r\n    \"note\": \"Pushed with the evidence commit in the same session; see the branch's PR.\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
