{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_446","type":"reasoning","text":"Now I have the definitive plan. Let me record what I found:\n\n**Baseline (agent workspace) state** = baseRevision 72ba3c32 content for these files:\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/shared/tool-registration.ts`: hash 7217cc1e... (NO durable_state)\n- `tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts`: ABSENT in agent workspace (scrubbed, it's a preexisting oracle path)\n- `tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts`: ABSENT in agent workspace (scrubbed)\n- `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts`: ABSENT (scrubbed)\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts`: ABSENT\n- `harness/specs/tasks/a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md`: aa311d... (5 required tests; base content)\n- `tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts`: ABSENT (agent deliverable)\n\n**Grader restores** (candidateRevision 96afc2 content):\n- `tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts`: 8690822b... (candidate version with durable_state tests)\n- `tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts`: 585be3c6... (candidate version importing cross-area-facades)\n- `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts`: bf5559f7 (same as base — identical)\n- `tests/unit/policy-light-snapshotter.test.ts`: c1d7fd82 (same)\n- `tests/unit/shadow-write-event-recorder.test.ts`: 8d86315c (same)\n- `tests/unit/trace-namespace-enforcement.test.ts`: 8dfeebc6 (same)\n- `tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts`: 23b311a2 (candidate version = the deliverable)\n\nSo: the grader restores the *candidate-revision* versions of the 6 preexisting oracle tests + keeps its own hidden copy of a01-a1-gate-coverage. The agent workspace is at **base revision** for these files. The source files (`tool-registration.ts`, `cross-area-facades.ts`) are NOT restored by the grader — those are the agent's responsibility to produce (they are in `ownedPaths`/touchedAreas logically).\n\nWait — but the manifest's `inputDigests` lists digests:\n- `tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts`: `8690822b40173545badd0c6d3