pecs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\n- docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md\n- docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-acceptance.json\n- docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A01-SHA256SUMS\n\nThe targetScope doesn't list the source files (tool-registration.ts, cross-area-facades.ts, types.ts). But the oracle requires them. The reference solution (per manifest) has ownedPaths including these? Let me check: the reference solution's sourceRecord is a01-acceptance.json at the candidate. Hmm, the manifest `taskDigest` and the acceptance record show the candidate revision is 46e553fd (the original A01 commit) which did NOT touch tool-registration.ts or cross-area-facades.ts — because at that commit those already existed in the tree.\n\nBut in THIS historical re-run, the workspace is the BASE commit 72ba3c (which predates durable_state and cross-area-facades). So the re-verification must port the source support too.\n\nThe manifest inputDigests list only:\n- harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\n- the 7 test files\n\nThese are \"input digests\" — the oracle restores test files and checks the spec file digest. Note: tool-registration.test.ts and performance-budgets.test.ts digests in inputDigests are 8690822b... and 4502f116... wait let me re-check.\n\nFrom manifest:\n- tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts: 8690822b40173545badd0c6d3224baa1acd6eec5c1207e85492683fc420837ec → matches candidate/grader.\n- tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts: 4502f116876f3270c4d9eb5929461186d8038d7f973bcec23743bcaa4e1e5079 → does NOT match candidate 585be3c6. Hmm! Let me check what that hash corresponds to.\n\nLet me compute: candidate perf-budgets sha256 = 585be3c6a23b2023965e97e238535284e9e3a95d2752535a0e7e3875fa5d3635. Manifest says 4502f116.... Different. And grader copy = 585be3c6. So the manifest digest is a THIRD version.\n\nHmm, that's for the \"inputDigests\" which might be the digests of the *reference solution* files as recorded. Let